---
const { title = 'Biz Policy Radar' } = Astro.props;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>{title}</title><link rel="canonical" href={Astro.url.href} /><meta property="og:title" content={title} /><meta property="og:type" content="website" /><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({ '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebSite', name:'Biz Policy Radar', url:Astro.site?.toString() ?? 'https://example.com' })} /><style>:root{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;color:#172033;background:#f7f8fb}body{margin:0}.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:20px}header{background:#0f2547;color:white}nav a{color:white;margin-right:14px;text-decoration:none}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #e5e8ef;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin:14px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 10px #00000008}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf4ff;color:#174a8b;font-size:13px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:14px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow-x:auto}th,td{border:1px solid #e5e8ef;padding:8px;text-align:left}footer{margin-top:40px;color:#5d6678;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:640px){.wrap{padding:14px}nav a{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px}.card{border-radius:12px}}</style></head><body><header><div class="wrap"><h1>Biz Policy Radar</h1><nav><a href={base}>브리핑</a><a href={`${base}deadline/`}>마감임박</a><a href={`${base}segments/startup/`}>스타트업</a><a href={`${base}segments/solo-business/`}>1인 사업자</a><a href={`${base}segments/small-business/`}>소상공인</a><a href={`${base}methodology/`}>검증 원칙</a><a href={`${base}status/`}>상태</a></nav></div></header><main class="wrap"><slot /></main><footer class="wrap">이 페이지는 공식 공고를 바탕으로 한 일반 정보입니다. 신청 자격, 제출 서류, 세무·노무·법률 판단은 반드시 공식 원문과 관계 기관 또는 자격 전문가를 통해 확인하세요.</footer></body></html>
